### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

### Ask the campus agent
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "AI讲座怎么报名？"
}

### Send feedback
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chat_id": 1,
  "rating": "up",
  "comment": "回答清楚"
}

### Recent logs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/logs?limit=5

### Create knowledge item
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/knowledge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "canteen-hours",
  "category": "校园服务",
  "title": "食堂开放时间",
  "content": "第一食堂每天7:00-21:00开放。",
  "keywords": ["食堂", "开放", "时间"]
}
